# {{PACK_ID}} operation-pack scaffold

This directory is an **unregistered incubator scaffold**, not an executable or
official benchmark case. It was generated without importing or running any of
its code.

Before registration:

1. Replace every `TODO` with fully synthetic semantics. Never copy production
   records, messages, policies, thresholds, identifiers, prompts, or code.
2. Implement a strict pack-owned spec loader. There is no universal OperateBench
   workflow DSL.
3. Implement every `OperationDomain` method, deterministic reference agent and
   targeted negative agents.
4. Have an independent reviewer author the negative-control oracle. Do not
   generate it from the agents or evaluator.
5. Implement pack-owned run serialization and replay. SDK v2 does not make
   Artifact 8 generic.
6. Keep the partner PR wholly within its owner-namespaced package, tests,
   fixture and documentation. Do not edit `operatebench/sdk/builtins.py`.
7. Make `test_pack.py` pass, then ask a maintainer for a separate static
   registration admission change.

Registration means the development commands can dispatch to the pack. It does
not make the pack sealed, confirmatory, leaderboard-eligible, or model evidence.
See the repository's
[Partner Contribution Kit](https://github.com/DwellyOrg/OperateBench/blob/main/docs/PARTNER_CONTRIBUTION_KIT.md),
[operation contribution guide](https://github.com/DwellyOrg/OperateBench/blob/main/docs/CONTRIBUTING_OPERATIONS.md),
and [Operation Pack SDK](https://github.com/DwellyOrg/OperateBench/blob/main/docs/OPERATION_PACK_SDK.md).
